     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ahhh, ok. The Tvalue is equal to the std. difference in mean:<div><br></div><div>&gt; std.dif &lt;- log2FC[1]/SE[1]<br></div><div><div>&gt; p.value &lt;- pt(std.dif,3, lower.tail=F)*2</div></div></div>"
    ]
